# INTERNAL BUILD ARTEFACTS - NEVER PUBLISH. Added 2026-08-09.
#
# Measured today: 533 published demos exposed HARVEST.json and BUILD-REPORT.json at their own
# public demo URL. Anyone we emailed a link to could fetch our internal notes about their own
# business. On mike-s-auto-glass-express the harvest read "Nations Auto Glass is a growing
# multi-state company" - our evidence that we had scraped a competitor - readable at the URL we
# were about to send them. 105 of the first 120 demos carried an internal note or another
# client name in a publicly fetchable file.
#
# DEMO-VISUAL-FAIL.txt was the worst of them: our own note saying the demo failed, served from
# the prospect-facing URL.
#
# Every one of these lives in the build tree at _tmp/autodemo/demos/<slug>/, which is where
# tooling should read them. Nothing is lost by keeping them out of the public repo.
